{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game &quot;MALYSA&quot; unfolds from a first-person perspective.<br>Set in a dimly lit, damp sewer world rendered in 3D graphics, players control an amnesiac protagonist, exploring the environment, uncovering mysteries left on the map, and evading attacking creatures to ultimately escape the sewer in this &quot;3D Escape Horror Adventure.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong><br>The protagonist wakes up in a dark, damp sewer with no memory.<br>Who are they? Why are they here? To uncover these mysteries, they search for clues within the limited light, gradually unraveling the truth.<br>However, as the pieces of the puzzle come together, &quot;it&quot; emerges before them\u2014a grotesque, unexplainable creature beyond human understanding.<br>Guided by an unknown force, &quot;it&quot; relentlessly pursues the protagonist.<br>&quot;Can you remain calm and composed until the very end?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Message</strong><br>This game was created by a team of four individuals who came together through the internet.<br>Developed by the production team &quot;monotone,&quot; this is their first experimental project to be released to the world.<br>We hope our challenge reaches as many players as possible.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3716890?t=1753985352","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716890/b0465f852ab2c1e3d3994c876b8cdb8f2433489b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753985352","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716890/b14cb9a7622dc2090c957c88a1d461b3a9190c80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753985352","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3716890/b14cb9a7622dc2090c957c88a1d461b3a9190c80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753985352","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game &quot;MALYSA&quot; unfolds from a first-person perspective.<br>Set in a dimly lit, damp sewer world rendered in 3D graphics, players control an amnesiac protagonist, exploring the environment, uncovering mysteries left on the map, and evading attacking creatures to ultimately escape the sewer in this &quot;3D Escape Horror Adventure.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong><br>The protagonist wakes up in a dark, damp sewer with no memory.<br>Who are they? Why are they here? To uncover these mysteries, they search for clues within the limited light, gradually unraveling the truth.<br>However, as the pieces of the puzzle come together, &quot;it&quot; emerges before them\u2014a grotesque, unexplainable creature beyond human understanding.<br>Guided by an unknown force, &quot;it&quot; relentlessly pursues the protagonist.<br>&quot;Can you remain calm and composed until the very end?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Message</strong><br>This game was created by a team of four individuals who came together through the internet.<br>Developed by the production team &quot;monotone,&quot; this is their first experimental project to be released to the world.<br>We hope our challenge reaches as many players as possible.</p>","developers":["monotone"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto